ld also be considered for more severe cases, but it has more side effects and is generally reserved for those situations. Physical restraints (E) should be used as a last resort and only when absolutely necessary to prevent harm to the patient or others. Diphenhydramine (A) and phenobarbital (D) are less suitable for managing delirium in this context. \n"], "raw_output": "Option: B", "error": null}
